#: www/faq.php:42
msgid ""
"This page contains the FAQ for FreshPorts. Hopefully the questions are "
"arranged from general to specific. The more you know, the further down you "
"must read to find something you didn't already know."
msgstr ""
"本页收录了 FreshPorts 的常见问题。这些问题大致按从一般到具体的顺序排列——您懂"
"得越多，就得往下读得越远，才能找到还不知道的内容。"

#: www/faq.php:45
msgid "What is this website about?"
msgstr "这个网站是做什么的？"

#: www/faq.php:48
msgid ""
"This website will help you keep up with the latest releases of your favorite "
"software. When a new version of the software is available, FreshPorts will "
"send you an email telling you about the change."
msgstr ""
"本网站帮您随时掌握所喜爱软件的最新版本动态。一旦软件有新版本发布，FreshPorts "
"就会发送邮件告知您这一变化。"

#: www/faq.php:51
msgid "How do I use this?"
msgstr "如何使用本站？"

#: www/faq.php:56
msgid ""
"Your primary FreshPorts tool is your <b>watch list</b>. This is the "
"collection of ports which you have selected for FreshPorts to keep track of. "
"You will be emailed when a change is found for one of your watched ports."
msgstr ""
"您在 FreshPorts 上的首要工具就是<b>关注列表</b>。它是您挑选出来、交由 "
"FreshPorts 追踪的 Port 集合。一旦发现您关注的 Port 有变化，就会向您发送邮件。"

#: www/faq.php:59
msgid ""
"You can have more than one watch list. Most people would have one watch list "
"for each machine they administer. I suggest giving the watch list the same "
"name as the machine. Email notifications will contain headers with the list "
"name. You can use that for any filtering you may want to do (e.g. procmail)."
msgstr ""
"您可以拥有多个关注列表。大多数人会为自己管理的每台机器分别建一个关注列表。建"
"议给关注列表起与机器相同的名字。邮件通知的邮件头中会包含列表名称，您可以借此"
"做所需的过滤（例如 procmail）。"

#: www/faq.php:62
msgid "Some definitions"
msgstr "几个定义"

#: www/faq.php:67
msgid ""
"You should be familiar with the <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/doc/"
"en_US.ISO8859-1/books/handbook/ports.html\">Ports</a> section of <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/doc/en_US.ISO8859-1/books/handbook/"
"index.html\">The FreeBSD Handbook</a>. Pay careful attention to the "
"difference between a port and a package."
msgstr ""
"您应当熟悉 <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/doc/en_US.ISO8859-1/books/"
"handbook/index.html\">《FreeBSD 手册》</a>中的 <a href=\"https://"
"www.freebsd.org/doc/en_US.ISO8859-1/books/handbook/ports.html\">Ports</a> 一"
"章。请特别留意 Port 与软件包之间的区别。"

#: www/faq.php:69
msgid "Definitions for the hopelessly lazy"
msgstr "懒人版定义"

#: www/faq.php:73
msgid ""
"If you install the port, the source will be downloaded, patched if "
"necessary, compiled and installed. You will have a chance to set any "
"optional configuration items particular to that port. If the port is "
"dependent upon another port, that port will also be installed. After "
"installing, ports are identical to packages."
msgstr ""
"如果安装 Port，系统会下载源代码，视需要打上补丁，然后编译并安装。您还有机会设"
"置该 Port 特有的可选配置项。如果该 Port 依赖其他 Port，那些 Port 也会一并安"
"装。安装完成之后，Port 就和软件包没什么两样了。"

#: www/faq.php:76
msgid ""
"It is because of these compile time options that I prefer ports over "
"packages."
msgstr "正是因为有这些编译期选项，我更喜欢 Port 而非软件包。"

#: www/faq.php:78
msgid "What is a package?"
msgstr "什么是软件包？"

#: www/faq.php:80
msgid ""
"A package is a compiled port. It is a binary. When you install the package, "
"you will download a binary and it will be installed."
msgstr ""
"软件包就是编译好的 Port，本质是二进制文件。安装软件包时，您只需下载二进制文件"
"并安装即可。"

#: www/faq.php:83
msgid ""
"Packages often lag behind ports. That is usually because it takes time to "
"compile the packages, etc. If you want the latest version, and the package "
"is not available, then you should install the port."
msgstr ""
"软件包往往落后于 Port，这通常是因为编译软件包等需要时间。如果您想用最新版本，"
"而相应的软件包还没有，那就应该安装 Port。"

#: www/faq.php:86
msgid ""
"Not all ports can have packages, often because of license restrictions that "
"prevent binary distribution."
msgstr ""
"并非所有 Port 都有对应的软件包，原因往往是许可证限制禁止分发二进制文件。"

#: www/faq.php:90
msgid "How do I modify my watch list?"
msgstr "如何修改我的关注列表？"

#: www/faq.php:94
msgid "There are three easy ways to modify your watch list:"
msgstr "修改关注列表有三种简单方法："

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the 'add to watch list' icon, %2$s is the 'remove from watch list' icon.
#: www/faq.php:98
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Wherever you see a port, you can click on the Add (%1$s) / Remove (%2$s) "
"link as necessary (i.e. one-click watch list maintenance)."
msgstr ""
"无论在何处看到 Port，您都可以按需点击“添加（%1$s）/移除（%2$s）”链接（即一键"
"维护关注列表）。"

#: www/faq.php:99
msgid ""
"The 'watch list categories' link provides you with a list of categories. "
"Select the category, and then the ports within that category."
msgstr ""
"“关注列表分类”链接会为您列出各分类。请先选择分类，再选择该分类下的 Port。"

#: www/faq.php:100
msgid ""
"Use the 'upload' link to upload your pkg_info data into your watch list "
"staging area and then into your watch list."
msgstr ""
"使用“上传”链接，先将您的 pkg_info 数据上传到关注列表暂存区，再存入关注列表。"

#: www/faq.php:104
msgid ""
"One-click watch list maintenance operates only upon your default watch "
"lists. You can set one or more watch lists as being default."
msgstr ""
"一键维护关注列表只对您的默认关注列表生效。您可以将一个或多个关注列表设为默"
"认。"

#: www/faq.php:107
msgid "How do I empty my watch list?"
msgstr "如何清空我的关注列表？"

#: www/faq.php:111
msgid ""
"Via <a href=\"/watch-list-maintenance.php\">Watch List Maintenance</a>. "
"Select the watch lists you wish to empty, and follow the instructions "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"前往 <a href=\"/watch-list-maintenance.php\">关注列表维护</a>页面，选择您要清"
"空的关注列表，然后按照给出的说明操作。"

#: www/faq.php:114
msgid "How do I delete my account?"
msgstr "如何删除我的账户？"

#: www/faq.php:118
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Visit %s and click on the <b>Delete my account</b> link. It's just below "
"<b>update account</b>."
msgstr ""
"请访问 %s 并点击 <b>删除我的账户</b> 链接。它就在 <b>更新账户</b> 的下方。"

#: www/faq.php:125
msgid ""
"A port is a simple easy way to install an application. A port is a "
"collection of files. These files contain the location of the source file, "
"any patches which must be applied, instructions for building the "
"application, and the installation procedure. Removing an installed port is "
"also easy. For full details on how to use ports, please refer to the "
"official port documents in the <a href=\"https://www.FreeBSD.org/handbook/"
"\">FreeBSD Handbook</a>."
msgstr ""
"Port 是安装应用程序的简便方式。Port 是一组文件的集合，这些文件包含源文件的位"
"置、需要应用的补丁、构建应用程序的说明以及安装步骤。移除已安装的 Port 同样简"
"单。有关如何使用 Port 的完整细节，请参阅 <a href=\"https://www.FreeBSD.org/"
"handbook/\">FreeBSD 手册</a> 中的官方 Port 文档。"

#: www/faq.php:128
msgid "Where do ports come from?"
msgstr "Port 从何而来？"

#: www/faq.php:131
msgid ""
"Ports are created by other FreeBSD volunteers, just like you and just like "
"the creators of FreshPorts. The FreshPorts team does not create ports; we "
"just tell you about the latest changes. The FreeBSD Ports team creates, "
"maintains, and upgrades the ports."
msgstr ""
"Port 由其他 FreeBSD 志愿者创建，他们与您一样，也与 FreshPorts 的创建者一样。"
"FreshPorts 团队并不创建 Port，我们只负责告诉您最新的变更。FreeBSD Ports 团队"
"负责 Port 的创建、维护与升级。"

#: www/faq.php:134
msgid "Who do I talk to about a port?"
msgstr "关于 Port 的问题该找谁？"

#: www/faq.php:137
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The official mailing list is %s. More information about all FreeBSD mailing "
"lists can be obtained from <a href=\"https://www.FreeBSD.org/handbook/"
"eresources.html#eresources-mail\">FreeBSD Mailing Lists</a>."
msgstr ""
"官方邮件列表是 %s。有关 FreeBSD 全部邮件列表的更多信息，可以从 <a "
"href=\"https://www.FreeBSD.org/handbook/eresources.html#eresources-"
"mail\">FreeBSD 邮件列表</a> 中获取。"

#: www/faq.php:140
msgid "How do I get these ports?"
msgstr "如何获取这些 Port？"

#: www/faq.php:143
msgid ""
"For full information on how to obtain the ports which appear on this "
"website, please see <a href=\"https://www.FreeBSD.org/ports/\">FreeBSD "
"Ports</a>. The easiest way to get a port is via <span class=\"cmd\">git</"
"span>. An abbreviated example is:"
msgstr ""
"有关如何获取本网站所列 Port 的完整信息，请参见 <a href=\"https://"
"www.FreeBSD.org/ports/\">FreeBSD Ports</a>。获取 Port 最简单的方法是通过 "
"<span class=\"cmd\">git</span>。简短示例如下："

#: www/faq.php:150
msgid "How is the website updated?"
msgstr "本网站是如何更新的？"

#: www/faq.php:156
msgid "FreeBSD repository"
msgstr "FreeBSD 仓库"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a link whose text is 'FreeBSD repository'.
#: www/faq.php:156
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The source code for the entire FreeBSD operating system and the Ports tree "
"are stored in the official %s. The FreshPorts nodes then use <span "
"class=\"cmd\">git</span> to detect changes and load the new commits into its "
"database."
msgstr ""
"整个 FreeBSD 操作系统的源代码和 Ports 树都存放在官方的 %s 中。随后，"
"FreshPorts 的各个节点会使用 <span class=\"cmd\">git</span> 检测变更，并把新的"
"提交载入其数据库。"

#: www/faq.php:159
msgid ""
"In the past, FreshPorts would parse the emails sent out for each commit and "
"then load the information into a database. In theory, it's fairly straight "
"forward. In practice, there's much more to it than first meets the eye. The "
"website was updated as soon as the message arrived."
msgstr ""
"过去，FreshPorts 会解析每次提交时发出的邮件，然后把其中的信息载入数据库。理论"
"上这相当简单直接，实际上却远比乍看之下复杂得多。邮件一到，网站就会立即更新。"

#: www/faq.php:162
msgid "What does unknown mean for a revision number?"
msgstr "修订版号显示为“unknown”是什么意思？"

#: www/faq.php:165
msgid ""
"It means the data has been converted from an earlier version of the "
"FreshPorts database that did not record this information."
msgstr ""
"它表示这些数据是从更早版本的 FreshPorts 数据库转换而来的，而那个版本并不记录"
"这项信息。"

#: www/faq.php:168
msgid "Can I link to your site?"
msgstr "我可以链接到你们的网站吗？"

#: www/faq.php:171
msgid ""
"Yes, thank you, you can. No need to ask us. Just go ahead and do it. We "
"prefer the name FreshPorts (one word, mixed case). The following HTML is a "
"good place to start:"
msgstr ""
"当然可以，谢谢您！无需向我们询问，直接链接即可。我们希望使用 FreshPorts 这个"
"名称（一词连写，大小写混用）。下面的 HTML 可以作为起点："

#: www/faq.php:177
msgid "Here is a banner which you are free to use to link to this site:"
msgstr "下面是可随意用来链接本站的横幅图片："

#: www/faq.php:183
msgid "Here is the HTML for that graphic."
msgstr "下面是该图片对应的 HTML。"

#: www/faq.php:190
msgid "Please save this graphic on your website."
msgstr "请把这张图片保存到您的网站上。"

#: www/faq.php:193
msgid "What do these symbols mean?"
msgstr "这些图标是什么意思？"

#: www/faq.php:197
msgid "There are a few symbols you will see in this website."
msgstr "您会在这个网站上看到一些图标。"

#: www/faq.php:200
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Homepage: a link to the Project Page / home page for this port. A port can "
"have more <a href=\"https://github.com/FreshPorts/freshports/issues/"
"434\">than one homepage</a>. While I personally think the <a href=\"https://"
"docs.freebsd.org/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/#makefile-"
"www\">documentation</a> does not specifically allow for this, I think it "
"arose when <a href=\"https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/commit/?"
"id=b7f05445c00f2625aa19b4154ebcbce5ed2daa52\">WWW was moved</a> from %1$s to "
"%2$s."
msgstr ""
"主页：指向该 Port 项目页/主页的链接。Port 可以有<a href=\"https://github.com/"
"FreshPorts/freshports/issues/434\">不止一个主页</a>。虽然我个人认为这份<a "
"href=\"https://docs.freebsd.org/en/books/porters-handbook/makefiles/"
"#makefile-www\">文档</a>并没有明确允许这种做法，但我想这种情况出现在当年<a "
"href=\"https://cgit.freebsd.org/ports/commit/?"
"id=b7f05445c00f2625aa19b4154ebcbce5ed2daa52\">WWW 被移动</a>、从 %1$s 改为 "
"%2$s 的时候。"

#: www/faq.php:203
msgid ""
"Fallout: a link to search the <a href=\"https://lists.freebsd.org/archives/"
"freebsd-pkg-fallout/\">freebsd-pkg-fallout archives</a>. If the resulting "
"fallout list is empty: the port may have been skipped due to fallout of a "
"related port."
msgstr ""
"Fallout：用于搜索 <a href=\"https://lists.freebsd.org/archives/freebsd-pkg-"
"fallout/\">freebsd-pkg-fallout 归档</a> 的链接。如果得出的 fallout 列表为空，"
"说明该 Port 可能因相关 Port 的 fallout 而被跳过。"

#: www/faq.php:206
msgid "Repology: a link to search the Repology packaging hub for this port."
msgstr "Repology：用于在 Repology 软件包中心搜索该 Port 的链接。"

#: www/faq.php:209
msgid ""
"Find Bugs: a link to search for open Problem Reports (issues/bugs) for this "
"port."
msgstr "查找 Bug：用于搜索该 Port 未解决问题报告（issue/bug）的链接。"

#: www/faq.php:212
msgid "New Bug: a link to open a new Problem Report (issue/bug) for this port."
msgstr "新建 Bug：用于为该 Port 提交新问题报告（issue/bug）的链接。"

#: www/faq.php:215
msgid ""
"New: This port has been recently added. A port is marked as new for 10 days."
msgstr "新增：该 Port 是最近添加的。Port 会被标记为“新的”，为期 10 天。"

#: www/faq.php:218
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Forbidden: The port is marked as forbidden. If you view the port details, "
"you will see why. Most often, it is because of a security exploit. Packages "
"for a forbidden port are not built by the package cluster. Therefore, %s "
"will not work."
msgstr ""
"已禁止：该 Port 被标记为禁止。查看 Port 详情即可看到原因，最常见的原因是存在"
"可被利用的安全漏洞。软件包集群不会为已禁止的 Port 构建软件包，因此 %s 将无法"
"工作。"

#: www/faq.php:221
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Broken: The port is marked as broken. Perhaps it won't compile. Maybe it "
"doesn't work under FreeBSD right now. If you view the port details, you will "
"see the reason why. Packages for a broken port are not built by the package "
"cluster. Therefore, %s will not work."
msgstr ""
"已损坏：该 Port 被标记为损坏。也许它无法编译，也许目前它在 FreeBSD 上无法正常"
"工作。查看 Port 详情即可看到原因。软件包集群不会为已损坏的 Port 构建软件包，"
"因此 %s 将无法工作。"

#: www/faq.php:224
msgid ""
"Deprecated: The port is marked as deprecated. Perhaps it has exceeded its "
"lifetime or is obsolete."
msgstr "已弃用：该 Port 被标记为弃用。也许是它已超过使用寿命，或者已经过时。"

#: www/faq.php:227
msgid ""
"Expiration Date: The port has an expiration date. A port may be removed from "
"the tree after this date. Often added in conjunction with Deprecated."
msgstr ""
"到期日期：该 Port 设有到期日期。超过此日期后，Port 可能会从 Ports 树中移除。"
"此标记常与“已弃用”一同添加。"

#: www/faq.php:230
msgid ""
"Expired: The port has passed the expiration date. A port may be removed from "
"the tree after this date. Often added in conjunction with Deprecated."
msgstr ""
"已过期：该 Port 已超过到期日期。超过此日期后，Port 可能会从 Ports 树中移除。"
"此标记常与“已弃用”一同添加。"

#: www/faq.php:233
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Ignore: The port is marked as ignore. It probably does not build. Packages "
"for an ignored port are not built by the package cluster. Therefore, %s will "
"not work."
msgstr ""
"已忽略：该 Port 被标记为已忽略。它很可能无法构建。软件包集群不会为被忽略的 "
"Port 构建软件包，因此 %s 将无法工作。"

#: www/faq.php:236
msgid ""
"Files: If you click on this graphic, you will be taken to the list of files "
"touched by the commit in question."
msgstr "文件：点击此图标后，您会看到此次提交所改动文件的列表。"

#: www/faq.php:239
msgid ""
"Refresh: The system is in the process of refreshing that port by inspecting "
"the ports tree. You should rarely see this."
msgstr "刷新：系统正在检查 Ports 树，刷新该 Port。您很少会看到这个图标。"

#: www/faq.php:240
msgid ""
"If you do see one, chances are that the port contains an error that prevents "
"make(1) from running. For example:"
msgstr ""
"如果您确实看到了，很可能是因为该 Port 存在错误，导致 make(1) 无法运行。例如："

#: www/faq.php:249
msgid ""
"In such circumstances, the port committer is notified (if they have opted in "
"to the FreshPorts Sanity Check Report) and they should fix the problem as "
"soon as possible. Once you see a more recent commit without a refresh icon, "
"then the problem has been fixed. The refresh icons will go away after "
"FreshPorts has dealt with the old commits. This may take a few hours."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，该 Port 的提交者会收到通知（前提是其订阅了 FreshPorts 健全性检"
"查报告），并应尽快修复问题。一旦您看到更新的提交没有刷新图标，就说明问题已经"
"修复。等 FreshPorts 处理完旧提交后，刷新图标就会消失，这可能需要几个小时。"

#: www/faq.php:252
msgid "Deleted: This port has been removed from the ports tree."
msgstr "已删除：该 Port 已从 Ports 树中移除。"

#: www/faq.php:255
msgid ""
"These icons are for older commits. At one time, FreshPorts parsed emails. "
"This icon will appear alongside commits before the repo moved from <span "
"class=\"cmd\">subversion</span> to <span class=\"cmd\">git</span>. They "
"appear along side the commit message in the commit history. This link will "
"take you to the original message in the FreeBSD mailing list archives. Note "
"that it can take a few minutes for the message to appear in the archives. "
"This link will not appear for commit messages before 3 March 2002 (which is "
"the date FreshPorts started to store the message-id)."
msgstr ""
"这些图标对应较早的提交。FreshPorts 曾经解析邮件。仓库从 <span "
"class=\"cmd\">subversion</span> 迁移到 <span class=\"cmd\">git</span> 之前的"
"提交旁会显示此图标。它们显示在提交历史中提交消息的旁边。此链接会带您前往 "
"FreeBSD 邮件列表归档中的原始消息。注意，消息可能需要几分钟才会出现在归档中。"
"2002 年 3 月 3 日之前的提交消息不会显示此链接（FreshPorts 正是从那一天开始保"
"存 message-id 的）。"

#: www/faq.php:258
msgid ""
"FreshPorts commit message: This will take you to the FreshPorts commit "
"message and allow you to see all other ports which were affected by this "
"commit. This link will not appear for commit messages before 3 March 2002 "
"(which is the date FreshPorts started to store the message-id)."
msgstr ""
"FreshPorts 提交消息：此链接会带您前往 FreshPorts 的提交消息，让您看到受此次提"
"交影响的所有其他 Port。2002 年 3 月 3 日之前的提交消息不会显示此链接"
"（FreshPorts 正是从那一天开始保存 message-id 的）。"

#: www/faq.php:261
msgid ""
"NOTE: This link has been made redundant by recent advances in the Files "
"link. See next icon."
msgstr "注意：随着“文件”链接近期的改进，此链接已属多余。请参见下一个图标。"

#: www/faq.php:265
msgid ""
"Item is on one of your default watch lists: This port is on one of your "
"default watch lists. Click this icon to remove the port from your default "
"watch lists. This icon appears only if you are logged in."
msgstr ""
"条目已在您的某个默认关注列表中：该 Port 位于您的某个默认关注列表上。点击此图"
"标可将该 Port 从您的默认关注列表中移除。此图标仅在您已登录时才会显示。"

#: www/faq.php:268
msgid ""
"Add item to your default watch lists: This port is not on any of your "
"default watch lists. Click this icon to add the port to your default watch "
"lists. This icon appears only if you are logged in."
msgstr ""
"将条目添加到您的默认关注列表：该 Port 尚不在您的任何默认关注列表上。点击此图"
"标可将该 Port 添加到您的默认关注列表。此图标仅在您已登录时才会显示。"

#: www/faq.php:271
msgid ""
"Encoding Errors (not all of the commit message was ASCII): Some of the "
"commit message may be altered because of character conversion problems. We "
"display only UTF-8 and remove the offending characters. These errors may "
"occur in the log message or elsewhere in the commit email."
msgstr ""
"编码错误（提交消息并非全部为 ASCII）：由于字符转换问题，部分提交消息可能有所"
"改动。我们只显示 UTF-8，并移除有问题的字符。这类错误可能出现在日志消息中，也"
"可能出现在提交邮件的其他地方。"

#: www/faq.php:274
msgid ""
"Watch List Count (WLC): This is the number of watch lists which are watching "
"this port. This might give you an idea of the popularity of the port."
msgstr ""
"关注列表计数（WLC）：这是关注此 Port 的关注列表数量，可以让您大致了解该 Port "
"的受欢迎程度。"

#: www/faq.php:277
msgid ""
"Git Repository: This link will take you to the Git Repository entry for this "
"version of the file."
msgstr "Git 仓库：此链接会带您前往该文件此版本在 Git 仓库中的条目。"

#: www/faq.php:280
msgid ""
"SVN Repository: This link will take you to the Subversion Repository entry "
"for this version of the file."
msgstr "SVN 仓库：此链接会带您前往该文件此版本在 Subversion 仓库中的条目。"

#: www/faq.php:283
msgid ""
"CVS Repository: Deprecated, and historical. Probably does not appear much "
"any more. This link will take you to the CVS Repository entry for this "
"version of the file. This is for much older commits."
msgstr ""
"CVS 仓库：已弃用，属于历史遗留，现在应该很少出现了。此链接会带您前往该文件此"
"版本在 CVS 仓库中的条目，适用于更早期的提交。"

#: www/faq.php:286
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.vuxml.org/freebsd/\">VuXML</a> vulnerability. Click "
"icon for details."
msgstr ""
"存在 <a href=\"https://www.vuxml.org/freebsd/\">VuXML</a> 漏洞。点击图标查看"
"详情。"

#: www/faq.php:289
msgid ""
"A past <a href=\"https://www.vuxml.org/freebsd/\">VuXML</a> vulnerability. "
"Click icon for details. NOTE: A feature of security/vuxml is it names the "
"packages which a given vuln affects. If the port changes its package name, "
"past vulnerabilities won't show up in FreshPorts. That's because FreshPorts "
"does not store historical package names."
msgstr ""
"曾存在 <a href=\"https://www.vuxml.org/freebsd/\">VuXML</a> 漏洞。点击图标查"
"看详情。注意：security/vuxml 的一个特点是会指明某个漏洞影响的软件包。如果 "
"Port 更改了软件包名称，过去的漏洞将不会显示在 FreshPorts 中，因为 FreshPorts "
"不保存历史软件包名称。"

#: www/faq.php:292
msgid "This port has some restrictions on it."
msgstr "该 Port 受到一些限制。"

#: www/faq.php:295
msgid ""
"This port has some restrictions with respect to being included on a CD-ROM."
msgstr "该 Port 在收录到 CD-ROM 时存在限制。"

#: www/faq.php:298
msgid "This port will require interaction during installation."
msgstr "该 Port 在安装过程中需要交互。"

#: www/faq.php:301
msgid ""
"Dependency Search: Action depends on context. Click on this icon to search "
"for ports depending on the current port, ports maintained by the current "
"maintainer, or other commits by the current committer."
msgstr ""
"依赖搜索：具体作用取决于上下文。点击此图标可以搜索依赖于当前 Port 的 Port、当"
"前维护者所维护的 Port，或当前提交者的其他提交。"

#: www/faq.php:304
msgid ""
"Revision details. Click on the Files icon in the commit history and you'll "
"see what files in this port were touched by this commit. Click on the "
"Revision details to view the revision of the file associated with this "
"commit."
msgstr ""
"修订版详情。在提交历史中点击“文件”图标，就能看到此次提交改动了该 Port 中的哪"
"些文件。点击“修订版详情”可查看与此次提交相关联的文件修订版。"

#: www/faq.php:307
msgid ""
"Annotate: If you click on this graphic, you will be taken to a view of the "
"file in question, with a listing of the commits that last changed each line."
msgstr ""
"注解：点击此图标后，您会看到相关文件的视图，其中列出了最后修改每一行的各次提"
"交。"

#: www/faq.php:310
msgid ""
"Diff. Click on the Files icon in the commit history and you'll see what "
"files in this port were touched by this commit. Click on the Diff icon to "
"view the diff between this revision of the file and the previous revision."
msgstr ""
"差异。在提交历史中点击“文件”图标，就能看到此次提交改动了该 Port 中的哪些文"
"件。点击“差异”图标可查看该文件此修订版与上一修订版之间的差异。"

#: www/faq.php:313
msgid ""
"Sanity Test Failures. The maintainers and committers are good. But sometimes "
"a mistake slips through. This records the mistake to make it easier for "
"others to correct it if it goes unnoticed. If you see this icon next to a "
"commit, it failed a Sanity Test."
msgstr ""
"健全性测试失败。维护者和提交者都很出色，但有时难免出现疏漏。这里会记录这些疏"
"漏，这样即使问题未被察觉，其他人也更容易纠正。如果您在某个提交旁看到此图标，"
"说明该提交未通过健全性测试。"

#: www/faq.php:316
msgid ""
"Flagged Commit. This commit is on your list of flagged commits. Why would "
"you flag a commit? Perhaps you want to review that commit. Perhaps you want "
"to MFC it later. Click on this icon to remove the commit from your flag list."
msgstr ""
"已标记的提交。该提交在您的已标记提交列表中。为什么要标记一个提交？也许您想审"
"阅该提交，也许您想稍后进行 MFC。点击此图标可将该提交从您的标记列表中移除。"

#: www/faq.php:319
msgid "Click on this icon to add the commit to your flagged list."
msgstr "点击此图标可将该提交添加到您的已标记列表中。"

#: www/faq.php:322
msgid ""
"Ascending / Descending: These icons appear on particular tables and allow "
"changing the order rows are sorted by."
msgstr "升序 / 降序：这些图标会出现在某些表格上，用于更改行的排序顺序。"

#: www/faq.php:326
msgid "Why don't my old bookmarks work?"
msgstr "为什么我的旧书签失效了？"

#: www/faq.php:331
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Many things changed between FP1 and FP2. The most major change was in the "
"underlying database schema. Not only did we move from <a href=\"https://"
"www.mysql.org/\">mySQL</a> to <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/"
"\">PostgreSQL</a>, we made major changes to the tables and the way in which "
"the ports are stored in the database. As a result of these changes, many "
"internal IDs and values are no longer valid. Therefore, URLs such as %s no "
"longer work."
msgstr ""
"FP1 与 FP2 之间改动了很多东西，其中最大的变化在于底层数据库模式。我们不仅从 "
"<a href=\"https://www.mysql.org/\">mySQL</a> 迁移到了 <a href=\"https://"
"www.postgresql.org/\">PostgreSQL</a>，还对数据表以及 Port 在数据库中的存储方"
"式做了重大调整。受这些变化影响，许多内部 ID 和值已不再有效，因此像 %s 这样的 "
"URL 已无法使用。"

#: www/faq.php:334
msgid ""
"If it is any consolation, the new URLs are transparent and permanent. They "
"are of the form &lt;category&gt;/&lt;port&gt;."
msgstr ""
"聊以慰藉的是，新的 URL 透明且永久，其形式为 &lt;category&gt;/&lt;port&gt;。"

#: www/faq.php:338
msgid "Do you have any news feeds?"
msgstr "你们有新闻源吗？"

#: www/faq.php:343
msgid "Yes. Read <a href=\"/backend/newsfeeds.php\">all about it</a>!"
msgstr "有。请阅读<a href=\"/backend/newsfeeds.php\">详细介绍</a>！"

#: www/faq.php:347
msgid "Can the main page load any faster?"
msgstr "主页还能加载得更快吗？"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a link to the FreshPorts home page URL.
#: www/faq.php:354
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s is the main page of this website. It contains a lot of information. You "
"can trim this information by using parameters."
msgstr "%s 是本网站的主页，其中包含大量信息。您可以使用参数来精简这些信息。"

#: www/faq.php:357
#, php-format
msgid "Try this URL: %s"
msgstr "试试这个 URL：%s"

#: www/faq.php:361
msgid ""
"<b>num</b> - number of ports to show (regardless of commits so the last "
"commit may not list fully). The valid values are 10..100."
msgstr ""
"<b>num</b>：要显示的 Port 数量（与提交数无关，因此最后一次提交可能不会完整列"
"出）。有效取值为 10..100。"

#: www/faq.php:364
msgid ""
"<b>days</b> - number of summary days (in the right hand column) to display. "
"The valid values are 0..9."
msgstr "<b>days</b>：要显示的汇总天数（显示在右栏）。有效取值为 0..9。"

#: www/faq.php:367
msgid ""
"<b>dailysummary</b> - similar to days, but displays a summary of the days "
"instead of a link to a page of commits for that day."
msgstr ""
"<b>dailysummary</b>：与 days 类似，但显示的是各天的摘要，而不是指向当天提交页"
"面的链接。"

#: www/faq.php:370
msgid "Here are a few examples:"
msgstr "下面举几个例子："

#: www/faq.php:375
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: www/faq.php:378
msgid "The last ten ports"
msgstr "最近的 10 个 Port"

#: www/faq.php:382
msgid "Same as above, but show only two days of previous commits"
msgstr "与上相同，但只显示前两天的提交"

#: www/faq.php:386
msgid "Same as above, but show summaries instead of a link to another page"
msgstr "与上相同，但显示摘要而不是指向另一页面的链接"

#: www/faq.php:392
msgid ""
"<b>NOTE:</b> Effective 13 November 2003, these parameters are no longer "
"available."
msgstr "<b>注意：</b>自 2003 年 11 月 13 日起，这些参数已不再可用。"

#: www/faq.php:396
msgid "How can I view the commits for a particular day?"
msgstr "如何查看某一天的提交？"

#: www/faq.php:401
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Yes, you can. %s displays all the commits for today (relative to the current "
"server time)."
msgstr "可以。%s 会显示今天的全部提交（以当前服务器时间为准）。"

#: www/faq.php:404
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You can also pass a parameter and view the commits for a given day. For "
"example, %s will show all the commits for 19 November 2002"
msgstr ""
"您也可以传入参数来查看指定日期的提交。例如，%s 会显示 2002 年 11 月 19 日的全"
"部提交"

#: www/faq.php:407
msgid ""
"The date should be of the format YYYY/MM/DD but I'm sure different formats "
"will work. If the code has trouble figuring out what date you mean, it will "
"guess and let you know it adjusted the date."
msgstr ""
"日期格式应为 YYYY/MM/DD，不过我相信其他格式也能用。如果代码无法确定您指的是哪"
"个日期，它会自行猜测，并告知您日期已作调整。"

#: www/faq.php:410
msgid "Why can't I add a port to my watch list?"
msgstr "为什么我无法把 Port 加入关注列表？"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the 'add to watch list' icon, %2$s is the 'on your watch list' icon.
#: www/faq.php:417
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You have clicked on the %1$s icon and it doesn't change to a %2$s. Yes, I've "
"had that happen too. What you need to do is check your <a href=\"/watch-list-"
"maintenance.php\">watch list settings</a>. You have probably selected "
"\"default watch list[s]\" when you don't have any default watch list[s] set. "
"To mark a watch list as a default, select it in the list, then click on the "
"Set Default button."
msgstr ""
"您点击了 %1$s 图标，但它并没有变成 %2$s。是的，我也遇到过这种情况。您需要检查"
"一下<a href=\"/watch-list-maintenance.php\">关注列表设置</a>：很可能是您在还"
"没有设置任何默认关注列表的情况下，就选择了“默认关注列表”。要将某个关注列表设"
"为默认，请先在列表中选中它，再点击“设为默认”按钮。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the 'on your watch list' icon, %2$s is the 'add to watch list' icon.
#: www/faq.php:422
#, php-format
msgid ""
"NOTE: The %1$s will only appear beside a port that is on one of your default "
"watch lists. If the port is on one of your non-default watch list, the %2$s "
"icon will appear instead. If you do not see what you expect, try setting the "
"default watch lists in your <a href=\"/watch-list-maintenance.php\">watch "
"list settings</a>."
msgstr ""
"注意：%1$s 只会出现在位于您某个默认关注列表中的 Port 旁。如果该 Port 在您的某"
"个非默认关注列表上，则会改为显示 %2$s 图标。如果看到的与预期不符，请尝试在<a "
"href=\"/watch-list-maintenance.php\">关注列表设置</a>中设置默认关注列表。"

#: www/faq.php:425
msgid "Why doesn't this port appear on my watch list?"
msgstr "为什么这个 Port 没有出现在我的关注列表上？"

#: www/faq.php:430
msgid "Please refer to the above question."
msgstr "请参阅上面的问题。"

#: www/faq.php:433
msgid "What are Port Moves?"
msgstr "什么是 Port Moves（Port 迁移）？"

#: www/faq.php:438
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some ports (for example <a href=\"/net/\">net</a>/<a href=\"/net/gift/"
"\">gift</a>) will have a section titled \"Port Moves\". FreshPorts obtains "
"information about ports from the commits to the %s."
msgstr ""
"有些 Port（例如 <a href=\"/net/\">net</a>/<a href=\"/net/gift/\">gift</a>）会"
"有标题为“Port Moves”的小节。FreshPorts 从发往 %s 的提交中获取 Port 信息。"

#: www/faq.php:438
msgid "repository"
msgstr "仓库"

#: www/faq.php:440
msgid ""
"With <span class=\"cmd\">subversion</span>, there could be a manual change "
"to the repository, not creating a commit email. Such moves were often "
"referred to as a <i>repo-copy</i>, and might have moved a port from one "
"category to another. Such a change was done to ensure the port history is "
"retained."
msgstr ""
"使用 <span class=\"cmd\">subversion</span> 时，仓库可能被手动修改而不产生提交"
"邮件。这类迁移通常被称为 <i>repo-copy</i>，可能会把某个 Port 从一个分类移动到"
"另一个分类。之所以这样做，是为了保留 Port 的历史记录。"

#: www/faq.php:442
msgid ""
"With <span class=\"cmd\">git</span>, <i>repo-copies</i> do not occur; the "
"changes are accomplished via commits."
msgstr ""
"使用 <span class=\"cmd\">git</span> 时则不会出现 <i>repo-copies</i>，这类变更"
"都通过提交来完成。"

#: www/faq.php:445
msgid ""
"Such moves/commits are documented in <a href=\"/MOVED\">/usr/ports/MOVED</"
"a>. FreshPorts parses this file and records these changes in its database."
msgstr ""
"这类迁移/提交都记录在 <a href=\"/MOVED\">/usr/ports/MOVED</a> 中。FreshPorts "
"会解析这个文件，并将这些变更记录到自己的数据库中。"

#: www/faq.php:448
msgid "This new feature was added on 31 December 2003."
msgstr "这项新功能于 2003 年 12 月 31 日加入。"

#: www/faq.php:452
msgid "What is /usr/ports/UPDATING?"
msgstr "什么是 /usr/ports/UPDATING？"

#: www/faq.php:457
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is similar to %2$s, but for ports, not for the source tree."
msgstr "%1$s 与 %2$s 类似，但面向的是 Port，而非源代码树。"

#: www/faq.php:460
msgid ""
"FreshPorts parses this file and attempts to relate the entries to any ports "
"it can find. Such relations are not always possible. We do the best we can. "
"The <a href=\"/net/openldap22-client/\">net/openldap22-client</a> port is a "
"good example of what to expect."
msgstr ""
"FreshPorts 会解析这个文件，并尝试把其中的条目与能找到的 Port 关联起来。这种关"
"联并非总能实现，我们只能尽力而为。<a href=\"/net/openldap22-client/\">net/"
"openldap22-client</a> 这个 Port 就是很好的例子。"

#: www/faq.php:464
msgid "What are Master/Slave ports?"
msgstr "什么是 Master/Slave Port？"

#: www/faq.php:469
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Some ports are so similar to another port that it makes sense to maintain "
"just one port and specify the differences in the other port. This is "
"slightly similar to the way %1$s is related to %2$s."
msgstr ""
"有些 Port 与另一个 Port 极为相似，因此只需维护其中一个 Port，并在另一个 Port "
"中写明差异。这有点类似于 %1$s 与 %2$s 之间的关系。"

#: www/faq.php:472
msgid ""
"A good example is <a href=\"/www/\">www</a>/<a href=\"/www/"
"mod_php4\">mod_php4</a>. You can see that the <b>master port</b> for that is "
"<a href=\"/lang/\">lang</a>/<a href=\"/lang/php4/\">php4</a>. Conversely, <a "
"href=\"/lang/\">lang</a>/<a href=\"/lang/php4/\">php4</a> lists several "
"<b>slave ports</b>."
msgstr ""
"很好的例子是 <a href=\"/www/\">www</a>/<a href=\"/www/mod_php4\">mod_php4</"
"a>。可以看到，它的 <b>主 Port（master port）</b> 是 <a href=\"/lang/\">lang</"
"a>/<a href=\"/lang/php4/\">php4</a>。反过来，<a href=\"/lang/\">lang</a>/<a "
"href=\"/lang/php4/\">php4</a> 则列出了多个 <b>从属 Port（slave port）</b>。"

#: www/faq.php:475
msgid "The ability to add this feature is because of this patch:"
msgstr "这项功能之所以能够加入，要归功于这个补丁："

#: www/faq.php:500
msgid ""
"The FreeBSD tree has no defined method for handling master/slave ports. It "
"is because of this that FreshPorts never attempted to refresh slave ports "
"when a master port was updated. Now that we have a mostly-reliable method, "
"all slave ports are refreshed when the master port is updated."
msgstr ""
"FreeBSD 树中没有定义处理 master/slave Port 的方法。正因为如此，过去主 Port 更"
"新时，FreshPorts 从不尝试刷新从属 Port。如今我们的方法已经基本可靠，主 Port "
"更新时，所有从属 Port 都会被刷新。"

#: www/faq.php:503
msgid ""
"This method works for all but 40 ports which are involved in a master/slave "
"relationship. It is hoped that those 40 are fixed soon. It is also hoped "
"that the above patch is committed to the tree."
msgstr ""
"除 40 个 Port 外，这一方法对所有存在 master/slave 关系的 Port 都有效。希望这 "
"40 个 Port 能尽快修复，也希望上述补丁能提交到树中。"

#: www/faq.php:507
msgid "What is this \"to add the package\" stuff?"
msgstr "这个“to add the package”（添加软件包）是怎么回事？"

#: www/faq.php:512
msgid ""
"Included within the port description is the instruction for adding the "
"package. This information can be important when the package name does not "
"match the port name. A good example is <a href=\"/x11/\">x11</a>/<a href=\"/"
"x11/XFree86-4-clients/\">XFree86-4-clients</a>. The command to add this "
"package is:"
msgstr ""
"Port 描述中就包含添加软件包的说明。当软件包名称与 Port 名称不一致时，这一信息"
"可能非常重要。很好的例子是 <a href=\"/x11/\">x11</a>/<a href=\"/x11/"
"XFree86-4-clients/\">XFree86-4-clients</a>。添加该软件包的命令是："

#: www/faq.php:519
msgid ""
"This normally isn't a problem, but for the 1900 or so ports which are "
"different, this information is very useful."
msgstr ""
"这通常不成问题，但对于那约 1900 个名称不同的 Port 来说，这条信息非常有用。"

#: www/faq.php:522
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If the %1$s information does not appear, you'll be told why there is no "
"package. This is controlled by the %2$s variable in the port's Makefile."
msgstr ""
"如果没有显示 %1$s 信息，则会告诉您为什么没有相应的软件包。这由 Port 的 "
"Makefile 中的 %2$s 变量控制。"

#: www/faq.php:525
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Broken, ignored, and forbidden ports are not built by the package cluster. "
"Therefore, there is no package for %s to use."
msgstr ""
"软件包集群不会为已损坏、被忽略和已禁止的 Port 构建软件包，因此 %s 没有软件包"
"可用。"

#: www/faq.php:528
msgid "Why does the search page use GET and not POST?"
msgstr "搜索页面为什么使用 GET 而不是 POST？"

#: www/faq.php:533
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you visit the <a href=\"/search.php\">search</a> page, and you run a "
"search, you'll find that the URL becomes very long. For example, %s."
msgstr ""
"如果您访问<a href=\"/search.php\">搜索</a>页面并执行一次搜索，就会发现 URL 变"
"得很长。例如：%s。"

#: www/faq.php:533
msgid "this really long link"
msgstr "这个超长链接"

#: www/faq.php:535
msgid ""
"Long URLs occur like that because the search form uses a GET. A long URL "
"would not occur if it was using a POST. The long URLs are useful because "
"they allow you to bookmark your favorite search. That is why a GET is used "
"instead of a POST."
msgstr ""
"会出现这么长的 URL，是因为搜索表单用的是 GET 方式；如果用 POST，就不会出现长 "
"URL。长 URL 很有用，因为您可以把惯用的搜索收藏为书签。这正是我们用 GET 而不"
"用 POST 的原因。"

#: www/faq.php:538
msgid ""
"It also makes it easier to <a href=\"https://validator.w3.org/\">validate "
"the HTML</a> if you can provide a URL that exercises all the options that "
"require testing."
msgstr ""
"只要提供的 URL 能覆盖所有需要测试的选项，<a href=\"https://validator.w3.org/"
"\">验证 HTML</a> 也会更容易。"

#: www/faq.php:541
msgid "What are all those fields I can search on?"
msgstr "那些可供搜索的字段都是什么？"

#: www/faq.php:546
msgid ""
"For those familiar with the FreeBSD ports structure, the following fields "
"indicate their origin:"
msgstr "对熟悉 FreeBSD Ports 结构的用户来说，以下字段标明了各自数据的来源："

#: www/faq.php:550
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: www/faq.php:550
msgid "Origin"
msgstr "来源"

#: www/faq.php:551 www/search.php:1225
msgid "Port Name"
msgstr "Port 名称"

#: www/faq.php:552 www/search.php:1222
msgid "Package Name"
msgstr "软件包名称"

#: www/faq.php:553
msgid "Latest Link"
msgstr "最新链接"

#: www/faq.php:554 www/ports-conflicts.php:42 www/search.php:1218
msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "维护者"

#: www/faq.php:555 www/search.php:1226
msgid "Short Description"
msgstr "简短描述"

#: www/faq.php:556 www/search.php:1217
msgid "Long Description"
msgstr "详细描述"

#: www/faq.php:557 www/search.php:1211
msgid "Depends Build"
msgstr "构建依赖"

#: www/faq.php:558 www/search.php:1212
msgid "Depends Lib"
msgstr "库依赖"

#: www/faq.php:559 www/search.php:1213
msgid "Depends Run"
msgstr "运行依赖"

#: www/faq.php:560 www/search.php:1221
msgid "Message ID"
msgstr "消息 ID"

#: www/faq.php:560
msgid "The message id in the original commit email"
msgstr "原始提交邮件中的消息 ID"

#: www/faq.php:561 www/faq.php:562
#, php-format
msgid "output from %s"
msgstr "%s 的输出"

#: www/faq.php:565
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For all of the above origins, you can obtain the value using %s. For example:"
msgstr "对上述所有来源，您都可以用 %s 取得相应的值。例如："

#: www/faq.php:574
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This value is obtained from a file in the port directory. For example %s."
msgstr "这个值取自 Port 目录下的某个文件。例如 %s。"

#: www/faq.php:577
msgid ""
"Where did this \"People watching this port, also watch\" feature come from?"
msgstr "这个“关注此 Port 的人还关注”功能是从哪儿来的？"

#: www/faq.php:582
msgid ""
"Like many FreshPorts features, this idea came from someone else. Florent "
"Thoumie mentioned something about extending the ports system to include "
"recommendations from maintainers/committers. Such a feature would allow a "
"committer/maintainer to suggest, for example, that if you install Firefox, "
"that you also install linuxflashplugin."
msgstr ""
"和 FreshPorts 的许多功能一样，这个点子也来自他人。Florent Thoumie 曾提到过扩"
"展 Ports 系统、加入维护者/提交者推荐的想法。有了这样的功能，提交者/维护者便可"
"以建议：比如说，您装了 Firefox，最好也装上 linuxflashplugin。"

#: www/faq.php:585
msgid ""
"It was from this concept that I came up with \"People watching this port..."
"\". This information is obtained by:"
msgstr ""
"正是从这个概念出发，我想出了“关注此 Port 的人……”这一功能。这些信息按如下方式"
"获得："

#: www/faq.php:587
msgid "FreshPorts takes the port you are looking at"
msgstr "FreshPorts 取出您正在查看的 Port"

#: www/faq.php:588
msgid "It finds all the watch lists that this port appears on"
msgstr "找出包含该 Port 的所有关注列表"

#: www/faq.php:589
msgid "It finds the top 5 most popular ports on those lists"
msgstr "在这些列表中找出最受欢迎的前 5 个 Port"

#: www/faq.php:590
msgid "FreshPorts shows you the results"
msgstr "FreshPorts 把结果显示给您"

#: www/faq.php:594
msgid "All of this takes about 55ms."
msgstr "这一切只需大约 55 毫秒。"

#: www/faq.php:597
msgid "What do you mean, the master port has been updated?"
msgstr "什么叫“主 Port 已更新”？"

#: www/faq.php:602
msgid ""
"For some slave ports, you may see a message like this, just above the "
"<b>Commit History</b>:"
msgstr "对于某些从属 Port，您可能会在 <b>提交历史</b> 上方看到类似这样的消息："

#: www/faq.php:605
msgid ""
"NOTE: This slave port may no longer be vulnerable to issues shown below "
"because the master port has been updated."
msgstr ""
"注意：由于主 Port 已经更新，此从属 Port 可能已不再受下方所示问题的影响。"

#: www/faq.php:609
msgid ""
"Slave ports can be updated with a commit against the master port. A commit "
"against the master port will affect any slave ports. If a <a href=\"https://"
"www.vuxml.org/freebsd/\">VuXML</a> vulnerability has been recorded against a "
"slave port, any fix would be applied to the master port. However, the commit "
"to the master port would not appear under the slave port, thereby giving a "
"false impression that the slave port was still vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"从属 Port 可以通过针对主 Port 的提交来更新。针对主 Port 的提交会影响所有从属 "
"Port。如果某个从属 Port 记录了 <a href=\"https://www.vuxml.org/freebsd/"
"\">VuXML</a> 漏洞，任何修复都会应用到主 Port 上。然而，针对主 Port 的提交不会"
"出现在从属 Port 页面之下，从而让人误以为该从属 Port 仍然存在漏洞。"

#: www/faq.php:612
msgid ""
"The above notice serves as a reminder that the slave port may no longer be "
"vulnerable."
msgstr "上面这则提示是提醒您：该从属 Port 可能已不再存在漏洞。"

#: www/faq.php:615
msgid "How does FreshPorts determine the master sites?"
msgstr "FreshPorts 是如何确定主站点的？"

#: www/faq.php:620
msgid ""
"Each port displays the master sites from which its distfiles can be "
"downloaded. This information is obtained from \"make master-sites-all\". "
"However, this is not the only list of master sites that a port knows about. "
"Edwin Groothuis explains it in this <a href=\"https://docs.freebsd.org/cgi/"
"mid.cgi?20041219204057.GE63708\">email</a>."
msgstr ""
"每个 Port 都会显示可供下载其 distfiles 的主站点。这些信息来自“make master-"
"sites-all”的输出。不过，这并不是 Port 所知的唯一一份主站点列表。Edwin "
"Groothuis 在这封<a href=\"https://docs.freebsd.org/cgi/mid.cgi?"
"20041219204057.GE63708\">邮件</a>中做了解释。"

#: www/faq.php:623
msgid ""
"In short, FreshPorts displays the list of master sites that should contain "
"all the distfiles. That is why we use that value, and not one of the other "
"options."
msgstr ""
"简而言之，FreshPorts 显示的是应当包含全部 distfiles 的那份主站点列表。这正是"
"我们选用该值而非其他选项的原因。"

#: www/faq.php:626
msgid "Why don't you obscure email addresses?"
msgstr "你们为什么不把电子邮件地址做模糊处理？"

#: www/faq.php:631
msgid ""
"FreshPorts used to obscure email addresses, but we don't any more. We "
"realised that every email address on FreshPorts is already somewhere else "
"first. For example:"
msgstr ""
"FreshPorts 曾对电子邮件地址做模糊处理，但现在不这么做了。我们意识到，"
"FreshPorts 上的每个电子邮件地址都早已出现在其他地方。例如："

#: www/faq.php:634
msgid "www/ports pages"
msgstr "www/ports 页面"

#: www/faq.php:636
msgid "fenner's output"
msgstr "fenner 的输出"

#: www/faq.php:638
msgid "cvsweb (now deprecated)"
msgstr "cvsweb（现已弃用）"

#: www/faq.php:639
msgid ""
"<span class=\"cmd\">subversion</span> (still online, but replaced by <span "
"class=\"cmd\">git</span>)"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"cmd\">subversion</span>（仍在线，但已被 <span "
"class=\"cmd\">git</span> 取代）"

#: www/faq.php:644
msgid ""
"In short, it doesn't make sense to obscure that which is freely available "
"elsewhere."
msgstr "简而言之，把别处唾手可得的信息遮起来，实在没有意义。"

#: www/faq.php:648
msgid ""
"Similarly, we do not entertain requests to remove information from our "
"website. We only report upon what exists elsewhere."
msgstr "同样，我们也不受理从本网站删除信息的请求。我们只报道别处已有的内容。"

#: www/faq.php:653
msgid ""
"Why does the PORTVERSION at the top of page differ from that of the first "
"commit?"
msgstr "为什么页面顶部的 PORTVERSION 与第一条提交中的不一样？"

#: www/faq.php:658
msgid "This question refers to a port page."
msgstr "这个问题针对的是 Port 页面。"

#: www/faq.php:661
msgid ""
"This situation usually occurs with MASTER/SLAVE ports. The Master port is "
"updated with a new REVISION. No commit is done against the Slave port. "
"FreshPorts knows to refresh the Slave port when its Master port is updated. "
"This refresh updates the PORTVERSION at the top of the page. This update "
"reflects the REVISION you would get if you were to install the Slave port "
"now that the Master has been upgraded."
msgstr ""
"这种情况通常发生在主 Port 与从属 Port 之间：主 Port 更新到了新的修订版"
"（REVISION），而针对从属 Port 没有任何提交。FreshPorts 知道，主 Port 更新时应"
"当刷新从属 Port。这次刷新会更新页面顶部的 PORTVERSION。它反映的是：既然主 "
"Port 已经升级，此时安装从属 Port 会得到的修订版。"

#: www/faq.php:664
msgid "What HTML anchors exist?"
msgstr "有哪些 HTML 锚点？"

#: www/faq.php:668
msgid "Anchors in port pages include:"
msgstr "Port 页面中的锚点包括："

#: www/faq.php:708
msgid "Anchors make it easier to link to sections within pages."
msgstr "锚点让链接到页面内的各个小节变得更方便。"

#: www/faq.php:711
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For example, this link – note the %s at its tail – takes you to the commit "
"history for security/acme.sh:"
msgstr ""
"例如，这个链接——注意其末尾的 %s——会带您前往 security/acme.sh 的提交历史："

#: www/faq.php:717
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Each of these sections has a %s link beside its heading. Click it, or copy "
"it, to get a link to that section."
msgstr ""
"每个小节的标题旁都有一个 %s 链接。点击或复制它，即可得到指向该小节的链接。"

#: www/faq.php:720
msgid "Enjoy. We can add more anchors upon request."
msgstr "祝您用得开心。如有需要，我们可以应要求添加更多锚点。"

#: www/faq.php:724
msgid "Can I get alerts for new packages?"
msgstr "我能收到新软件包的提醒吗？"

#: www/faq.php:728
msgid "Yes, yes, you can."
msgstr "能，当然能。"

#: www/faq.php:730
msgid ""
"Not only can FreshPorts email you when one of your watched ports is updated, "
"it can also email you when the package is ready to install."
msgstr ""
"FreshPorts 不仅能在您关注的某个 Port 更新时给您发邮件，还能在相应软件包可以安"
"装时再给您发一封。"

#: www/faq.php:732
msgid ""
"FreshPorts polls the available FreeBSD repo builds on an hourly basis. It "
"uses that information to display the packages available under various ABI "
"(e.g. FreeBSD:14:amd64). NOTE: we do not display packages for the quarterly "
"branch on the latest CURRENT of FreeBSD. Packages are not built for that ABI/"
"package set combination. You may see CURRENT/quarterly listed on some pages. "
"That is easier to do than to keep track of which branch is CURRENT."
msgstr ""
"FreshPorts 每小时轮询一次可用的 FreeBSD 仓库构建，并利用这些信息显示各种 ABI"
"（例如 FreeBSD:14:amd64）下可用的软件包。注意：对于 FreeBSD 最新的 CURRENT，"
"我们不显示 quarterly 分支的软件包，因为这种 ABI/软件包集组合并不构建软件包。"
"您可能会在某些页面上看到 CURRENT/quarterly 的字样——比起随时追踪哪个分支是 "
"CURRENT，这样列出更省事。"

#: www/faq.php:734
