"我非常感谢为本网站提供帮助的安全研究人员所做的贡献。请注意，本网站不以营利为"
"目的，它只是我的个人爱好，是我业余时间做的事，为开源社区提供的一项服务。"

#: www/security-policy.php:35
msgid ""
"With that in mind, do not expect to make a living getting bounties on this "
"website. With your consent, I will list your contributions here. Your "
"contribution can be anonymous if you wish. I am happy to acknowledge the "
"work you do and the findings you present."
